\section{Analysis Approach}

\subsection{Quantitative Analysis}

\textbf{Descriptive Statistics:} Central tendency (mean, median, mode) for all metrics; dispersion (standard deviation, IQR, range); distribution visualisation (histograms, box plots).

\textbf{Comparative Analysis:} Paired comparisons (CCRMS vs. Ethereum L2, CCRMS vs. centralised); statistical significance testing where appropriate (t-tests, Mann-Whitney U); effect size calculation (Cohen's d).

\textbf{Performance Modelling:} Regression analysis for latency vs. load relationships; capacity modelling using queuing theory; cost projection models.

\subsection{Qualitative Analysis}

\textbf{Thematic Analysis:} Open coding of interview transcripts; axial coding to identify relationships; selective coding for core themes.

\textbf{Usability Analysis:} SUS score calculation and benchmarking; task completion rate analysis; error classification and frequency.

